{"id":"forecast-19","section":4,"path":"bank/listening/forecast-19/audio-4.m4a","model":"small","duration":1083.21,"segments":[{"start":0.11,"end":9.99,"text":"Section 4. You will hear an extract from a talk entitled Respecting Overnus. First, you have some","words":[["Section",0.11,0.75],["4.",0.75,1.23],["You",2.35,2.57],["will",2.57,2.75],["hear",2.75,3.07],["an",3.07,3.35],["extract",3.35,3.73],["from",3.73,4.45],["a",4.45,4.63],["talk",4.63,4.91],["entitled",4.91,5.53],["Respecting",5.53,6.91],["Overnus.",6.91,7.51],["First,",8.33,8.97],["you",9.51,9.63],["have",9.63,9.81],["some",9.81,9.99]]},{"start":9.99,"end":56.89,"text":"time to look at questions 31 to 40 on page 7. Now listen carefully and answer questions","words":[["time",9.99,10.31],["to",10.31,10.51],["look",10.51,10.63],["at",10.63,10.75],["questions",10.75,11.07],["31",11.07,11.89],["to",11.89,12.15],["40",12.15,12.53],["on",12.53,13.27],["page",13.27,13.59],["7.",13.59,14.05],["Now",54.47,54.73],["listen",54.73,55.01],["carefully",55.01,55.45],["and",55.45,56.15],["answer",56.15,56.49],["questions",56.49,56.89]]},{"start":56.89,"end":67.74,"text":"31 to 40. Several times a year, newspaper readers all over the world can expect to read a story","words":[["31",56.89,57.81],["to",57.81,58.11],["40.",58.11,58.49],["Several",62.02,62.54],["times",62.54,62.94],["a",62.94,63.16],["year,",63.16,63.44],["newspaper",63.9,64.24],["readers",64.24,64.74],["all",64.74,65.18],["over",65.18,65.46],["the",65.46,65.6],["world",65.6,66.04],["can",66.04,66.5],["expect",66.5,66.82],["to",66.82,67.18],["read",67.18,67.26],["a",67.26,67.38],["story",67.38,67.74]]},{"start":67.74,"end":69.56,"text":"that goes roughly like this.","words":[["that",67.74,67.96],["goes",67.96,68.3],["roughly",68.3,68.86],["like",68.86,69.2],["this.",69.2,69.56]]},{"start":70.32,"end":77.56,"text":"Researchers have just discovered that monkeys or elephants or dolphins or raccoons, in fact,","words":[["Researchers",70.32,70.78],["have",70.78,71.68],["just",71.68,72.06],["discovered",72.06,72.6],["that",72.6,72.94],["monkeys",72.94,73.34],["or",73.34,73.82],["elephants",73.82,74.36],["or",74.36,74.82],["dolphins",74.82,75.28],["or",75.28,75.72],["raccoons,",75.72,76.5],["in",76.96,77.12],["fact,",77.12,77.56]]},{"start":77.72,"end":84.5,"text":"have the ability to count or add, subtract, create sentences, solve problems, make tools,","words":[["have",77.72,77.9],["the",77.9,78.06],["ability",78.06,78.54],["to",78.54,79.04],["count",79.04,79.5],["or",79.5,79.84],["add,",79.84,80.3],["subtract,",80.6,80.82],["create",81.38,81.6],["sentences,",81.6,82.18],["solve",82.62,82.8],["problems,",82.8,83.46],["make",83.8,83.94],["tools,",83.94,84.5]]},{"start":84.72,"end":85.46,"text":"or whatever.","words":[["or",84.72,84.88],["whatever.",84.88,85.46]]},{"start":86.28,"end":92.0,"text":"The most recent example of this phenomenon occurred a few weeks ago with a widely reported","words":[["The",86.28,86.7],["most",86.7,86.92],["recent",86.92,87.3],["example",87.3,87.86],["of",87.86,88.06],["this",88.06,88.24],["phenomenon",88.24,88.72],["occurred",88.72,89.54],["a",89.54,89.74],["few",89.74,89.88],["weeks",89.88,90.18],["ago",90.18,90.52],["with",90.52,91.02],["a",91.02,91.18],["widely",91.18,91.5],["reported",91.5,92.0]]},{"start":92.0,"end":98.54,"text":"a count of new research, showing or rather claiming to show that monkeys can count.","words":[["a",92.0,92.2],["count",92.2,92.54],["of",92.54,92.88],["new",92.88,93.1],["research,",93.1,93.7],["showing",94.02,94.46],["or",94.46,95.0],["rather",95.0,95.3],["claiming",95.3,95.84],["to",95.84,96.18],["show",96.18,96.48],["that",96.48,96.98],["monkeys",96.98,97.42],["can",97.42,98.14],["count.",98.14,98.54]]},{"start":99.32,"end":105.42,"text":"What happened was that some monkeys were carefully trained up to place groups of one to four","words":[["What",99.32,99.64],["happened",99.64,100.12],["was",100.12,100.7],["that",100.7,100.92],["some",100.92,101.16],["monkeys",101.16,101.5],["were",101.5,101.78],["carefully",101.78,102.2],["trained",102.2,102.64],["up",102.64,103.02],["to",103.02,103.46],["place",103.46,103.8],["groups",103.8,104.28],["of",104.28,104.62],["one",104.62,104.9],["to",104.9,105.12],["four",105.12,105.42]]},{"start":105.42,"end":111.48,"text":"items according to size, so they'd put the smallest group in one place, the next smallest","words":[["items",105.42,105.88],["according",105.88,106.22],["to",106.22,106.52],["size,",106.52,107.0],["so",107.54,107.76],["they'd",107.76,108.02],["put",108.02,108.14],["the",108.14,108.3],["smallest",108.3,108.76],["group",108.76,109.18],["in",109.18,109.38],["one",109.38,109.6],["place,",109.6,110.02],["the",110.38,110.56],["next",110.56,110.9],["smallest",110.9,111.48]]},{"start":111.48,"end":116.26,"text":"group in another place, and so on to the group containing the highest number.","words":[["group",111.48,111.84],["in",111.84,112.04],["another",112.04,112.32],["place,",112.32,112.72],["and",112.9,113.3],["so",113.3,113.6],["on",113.6,113.96],["to",113.96,114.36],["the",114.36,114.48],["group",114.48,114.74],["containing",114.74,115.24],["the",115.24,115.5],["highest",115.5,115.82],["number.",115.82,116.26]]},{"start":116.26,"end":123.18,"text":"However, they later showed, surprise, surprise, that without any further training, they could","words":[["However,",116.26,116.36],["they",116.86,117.24],["later",117.24,117.64],["showed,",117.64,118.2],["surprise,",118.56,119.22],["surprise,",119.6,119.88],["that",120.5,120.72],["without",120.72,120.94],["any",120.94,121.4],["further",121.4,121.72],["training,",121.72,122.36],["they",122.94,123.04],["could",123.04,123.18]]},{"start":123.18,"end":128.14,"text":"do exactly the same with bigger groups containing five to nine items.","words":[["do",123.18,123.36],["exactly",123.36,123.82],["the",123.82,124.08],["same",124.08,124.42],["with",124.42,124.92],["bigger",124.92,125.26],["groups",125.26,125.7],["containing",125.7,126.42],["five",126.42,126.96],["to",126.96,127.26],["nine",127.26,127.62],["items.",127.62,128.14]]},{"start":129.1,"end":134.74,"text":"It hardly needs me to point out that an experiment like that might suggest the animals concerned","words":[["It",129.1,129.3],["hardly",129.3,129.7],["needs",129.7,130.12],["me",130.12,130.38],["to",130.38,130.6],["point",130.6,130.9],["out",130.9,131.2],["that",131.2,131.4],["an",131.4,131.5],["experiment",131.5,131.96],["like",131.96,132.32],["that",132.32,132.64],["might",132.64,132.9],["suggest",132.9,133.36],["the",133.36,133.64],["animals",133.64,134.04],["concerned",134.04,134.74]]},{"start":134.74,"end":142.44,"text":"can recognize size, but does not prove that they can count like humans do, far from it.","words":[["can",134.74,135.28],["recognize",135.28,135.86],["size,",135.86,136.44],["but",136.8,137.32],["does",137.32,137.52],["not",137.52,137.88],["prove",137.88,138.42],["that",138.42,138.74],["they",138.74,138.92],["can",138.92,139.14],["count",139.14,139.78],["like",139.78,140.16],["humans",140.16,140.56],["do,",140.56,140.92],["far",141.42,141.86],["from",141.86,142.22],["it.",142.22,142.44]]},{"start":142.44,"end":149.78,"text":"Other experiments have involved training apes to push certain keys on a computer keyboard","words":[["Other",142.44,143.72],["experiments",143.72,144.38],["have",144.38,145.02],["involved",145.02,145.56],["training",145.56,146.06],["apes",146.06,146.74],["to",146.74,147.12],["push",147.12,147.46],["certain",147.46,147.86],["keys",147.86,148.4],["on",148.4,148.72],["a",148.72,148.86],["computer",148.86,149.24],["keyboard",149.24,149.78]]},{"start":149.78,"end":154.56,"text":"to write out sentences like please give sweets.","words":[["to",149.78,150.08],["write",150.08,150.32],["out",150.32,150.54],["sentences",150.54,151.1],["like",151.1,151.64],["please",151.64,152.58],["give",152.58,153.58],["sweets.",153.58,154.56]]},{"start":155.6,"end":163.44,"text":"According to published data, 96% of the so-called sentences produced are for immediate rewards","words":[["According",155.6,156.1],["to",156.1,156.46],["published",156.46,156.82],["data,",156.82,157.32],["96",157.94,158.32],["%",158.32,159.02],["of",159.02,159.28],["the",159.28,159.42],["so",159.42,159.58],["-called",159.58,159.92],["sentences",159.92,160.78],["produced",160.78,161.4],["are",161.4,162.12],["for",162.12,162.36],["immediate",162.36,162.86],["rewards",162.86,163.44]]},{"start":163.44,"end":166.66,"text":"such as food, toys, or tickling.","words":[["such",163.44,164.12],["as",164.12,164.28],["food,",164.28,164.72],["toys,",165.2,165.64],["or",166.16,166.26],["tickling.",166.26,166.66]]},{"start":166.66,"end":173.26,"text":"The problem, as I'm sure you are aware, is that simply labeling a button with a symbol","words":[["The",166.66,167.64],["problem,",167.64,168.16],["as",168.3,168.56],["I'm",168.56,168.84],["sure",168.84,169.14],["you",169.14,169.38],["are",169.38,169.58],["aware,",169.58,169.92],["is",170.52,170.72],["that",170.72,170.88],["simply",170.88,171.24],["labeling",171.24,171.7],["a",171.7,172.02],["button",172.02,172.38],["with",172.38,172.66],["a",172.66,172.82],["symbol",172.82,173.26]]},{"start":173.26,"end":180.14,"text":"and linking it closely to a reward does not add up to language production in any accepted","words":[["and",173.26,173.66],["linking",173.66,174.0],["it",174.0,174.24],["closely",174.24,174.66],["to",174.66,175.0],["a",175.0,175.16],["reward",175.16,175.64],["does",175.64,176.36],["not",176.36,176.66],["add",176.66,177.0],["up",177.0,177.16],["to",177.16,177.34],["language",177.34,177.72],["production",177.72,178.46],["in",178.46,179.12],["any",179.12,179.44],["accepted",179.44,180.14]]},{"start":180.14,"end":180.68,"text":"sense.","words":[["sense.",180.14,180.68]]},{"start":182.04,"end":187.58,"text":"Of course it's only human for us to observe animal behavior and then to interpret it in","words":[["Of",182.04,182.38],["course",182.38,182.62],["it's",182.62,182.88],["only",182.88,183.12],["human",183.12,183.5],["for",183.5,183.82],["us",183.82,184.0],["to",184.0,184.12],["observe",184.12,184.48],["animal",184.48,184.82],["behavior",184.82,185.34],["and",185.34,185.94],["then",185.94,186.1],["to",186.1,186.3],["interpret",186.3,186.88],["it",186.88,187.16],["in",187.16,187.58]]},{"start":187.58,"end":191.86,"text":"terms of our own thoughts, our own mental processes and emotions.","words":[["terms",187.58,187.86],["of",187.86,188.12],["our",188.12,188.3],["own",188.3,188.48],["thoughts,",188.48,188.96],["our",189.54,189.8],["own",189.8,190.0],["mental",190.0,190.3],["processes",190.3,190.86],["and",190.86,191.36],["emotions.",191.36,191.86]]},{"start":192.58,"end":199.38,"text":"It's hard for us to grasp that there is a profound otherness about the minds of animals.","words":[["It's",192.58,193.26],["hard",193.26,193.54],["for",193.54,193.78],["us",193.78,193.94],["to",193.94,194.08],["grasp",194.08,194.46],["that",194.46,195.04],["there",195.04,195.22],["is",195.22,195.42],["a",195.42,195.56],["profound",195.56,196.38],["otherness",196.38,197.68],["about",197.68,198.26],["the",198.26,198.48],["minds",198.48,198.82],["of",198.82,199.0],["animals.",199.0,199.38]]},{"start":200.22,"end":207.78,"text":"Dogs, for example, live in a universe of odors, and pigeons navigate by the magnetic pull of the Earth.","words":[["Dogs,",200.22,200.54],["for",200.74,200.86],["example,",200.86,201.28],["live",201.96,202.08],["in",202.08,202.22],["a",202.22,202.34],["universe",202.34,202.7],["of",202.7,202.98],["odors,",202.98,203.54],["and",204.38,204.6],["pigeons",204.6,204.94],["navigate",204.94,205.66],["by",205.66,206.26],["the",206.26,206.4],["magnetic",206.4,206.78],["pull",206.78,207.18],["of",207.18,207.36],["the",207.36,207.5],["Earth.",207.5,207.78]]},{"start":208.86,"end":218.62,"text":"We human beings, by contrast, are visual animals, and it's because of this that we rate other animals with good eyesight as being intelligent.","words":[["We",208.86,209.2],["human",209.2,209.6],["beings,",209.6,210.08],["by",210.22,210.4],["contrast,",210.4,210.96],["are",211.46,211.74],["visual",211.74,212.08],["animals,",212.08,212.62],["and",213.12,213.36],["it's",213.36,213.56],["because",213.56,213.92],["of",213.92,214.2],["this",214.2,214.46],["that",214.46,214.94],["we",214.94,215.12],["rate",215.12,215.4],["other",215.4,215.64],["animals",215.64,216.12],["with",216.12,216.38],["good",216.38,216.62],["eyesight",216.62,217.06],["as",217.06,217.64],["being",217.64,217.9],["intelligent.",217.9,218.62]]},{"start":219.4,"end":225.22,"text":"To give you an example, rats always used to be considered to be less clever than monkeys.","words":[["To",219.4,220.08],["give",220.08,220.3],["you",220.3,220.42],["an",220.42,220.56],["example,",220.56,221.06],["rats",221.68,221.96],["always",221.96,222.54],["used",222.54,222.82],["to",222.82,223.0],["be",223.0,223.1],["considered",223.1,223.52],["to",223.52,223.78],["be",223.78,223.92],["less",223.92,224.18],["clever",224.18,224.56],["than",224.56,224.88],["monkeys.",224.88,225.22]]},{"start":225.88,"end":231.92,"text":"Why? Simply because they did less well than monkeys on tests where they had to distinguish","words":[["Why?",225.88,226.28],["Simply",226.96,227.46],["because",227.46,227.84],["they",227.84,228.12],["did",228.12,228.32],["less",228.32,228.58],["well",228.58,228.88],["than",228.88,229.14],["monkeys",229.14,229.56],["on",229.56,230.2],["tests",230.2,230.6],["where",230.6,230.88],["they",230.88,231.02],["had",231.02,231.26],["to",231.26,231.38],["distinguish",231.38,231.92]]},{"start":231.92,"end":237.94,"text":"visual symbols from each other. However, when the rats were given a second try,","words":[["visual",231.92,232.68],["symbols",232.68,233.12],["from",233.12,233.46],["each",233.46,233.68],["other.",233.68,233.92],["However,",234.7,235.2],["when",235.7,235.92],["the",235.92,236.1],["rats",236.1,236.44],["were",236.44,236.64],["given",236.64,236.86],["a",236.86,237.08],["second",237.08,237.4],["try,",237.4,237.94]]},{"start":238.3,"end":242.34,"text":"this time with the task of distinguishing and remembering different smells,","words":[["this",238.3,238.6],["time",238.6,238.94],["with",238.94,239.14],["the",239.14,239.28],["task",239.28,239.7],["of",239.7,239.86],["distinguishing",239.86,240.6],["and",240.6,240.92],["remembering",240.92,241.4],["different",241.4,241.78],["smells,",241.78,242.34]]},{"start":242.78,"end":245.32,"text":"they passed the tests with flying colors.","words":[["they",242.78,242.98],["passed",242.98,243.36],["the",243.36,243.56],["tests",243.56,243.92],["with",243.92,244.42],["flying",244.42,244.86],["colors.",244.86,245.32]]},{"start":245.32,"end":255.86,"text":"Since the 1960s, a new model for animal understanding has become popular.","words":[["Since",245.32,246.44],["the",250.76,251.0],["1960s,",251.0,252.1],["a",252.5,252.7],["new",252.7,253.0],["model",253.0,253.4],["for",253.4,253.66],["animal",253.66,254.04],["understanding",254.04,254.7],["has",254.7,255.02],["become",255.02,255.28],["popular.",255.28,255.86]]},{"start":256.4,"end":264.08,"text":"This model, sometimes called the cognitive or informational model, in my opinion, provides us with the key.","words":[["This",256.4,256.58],["model,",256.58,256.96],["sometimes",257.36,257.72],["called",257.72,258.22],["the",258.22,258.42],["cognitive",258.42,258.92],["or",258.92,259.48],["informational",259.48,260.18],["model,",260.18,260.66],["in",261.08,261.2],["my",261.2,261.48],["opinion,",261.48,261.92],["provides",262.36,262.86],["us",262.86,263.34],["with",263.34,263.62],["the",263.62,263.78],["key.",263.78,264.08]]},{"start":264.9,"end":269.98,"text":"Instead of going for similarity or difference alone, it takes a more balanced approach","words":[["Instead",264.9,265.22],["of",265.22,265.44],["going",265.44,265.68],["for",265.68,265.94],["similarity",265.94,266.46],["or",266.46,266.9],["difference",266.9,267.28],["alone,",267.28,267.72],["it",268.38,268.54],["takes",268.54,268.74],["a",268.74,268.94],["more",268.94,269.1],["balanced",269.1,269.6],["approach",269.6,269.98]]},{"start":269.98,"end":278.34,"text":"and focuses attention on what makes animals both very similar to us and at the same time wholly different.","words":[["and",269.98,270.7],["focuses",270.7,271.18],["attention",271.18,271.66],["on",271.66,272.38],["what",272.38,272.64],["makes",272.64,273.0],["animals",273.0,273.46],["both",273.46,273.82],["very",273.82,274.46],["similar",274.46,274.88],["to",274.88,275.16],["us",275.16,275.46],["and",275.46,276.06],["at",276.06,276.22],["the",276.22,276.34],["same",276.34,276.62],["time",276.62,277.02],["wholly",277.02,277.9],["different.",277.9,278.34]]},{"start":279.88,"end":283.08,"text":"This model accepts that animals think.","words":[["This",279.88,280.56],["model",280.56,281.06],["accepts",281.06,281.84],["that",281.84,282.2],["animals",282.2,282.62],["think.",282.62,283.08]]},{"start":283.96,"end":286.62,"text":"Like us, they take information from their environment,","words":[["Like",283.96,284.2],["us,",284.2,284.54],["they",284.66,284.78],["take",284.78,285.04],["information",285.04,285.56],["from",285.56,285.9],["their",285.9,286.08],["environment,",286.08,286.62]]},{"start":287.04,"end":289.18,"text":"process it, and produce decisions.","words":[["process",287.04,287.48],["it,",287.48,287.82],["and",288.1,288.34],["produce",288.34,288.68],["decisions.",288.68,289.18]]},{"start":290.02,"end":294.78,"text":"The amazing thing, however, is that they do this without using language,","words":[["The",290.02,290.3],["amazing",290.3,290.82],["thing,",290.82,291.14],["however,",291.2,291.54],["is",291.98,292.22],["that",292.22,292.38],["they",292.38,292.5],["do",292.5,292.76],["this",292.76,293.04],["without",293.04,293.66],["using",293.66,294.24],["language,",294.24,294.78]]},{"start":295.44,"end":297.16,"text":"at least as we understand the term.","words":[["at",295.44,295.62],["least",295.62,295.82],["as",295.82,296.0],["we",296.0,296.2],["understand",296.2,296.7],["the",296.7,296.88],["term.",296.88,297.16]]},{"start":298.42,"end":301.48,"text":"Horses, for instance, can find their way home","words":[["Horses,",298.42,299.1],["for",299.16,299.34],["instance,",299.34,299.62],["can",300.18,300.36],["find",300.36,300.68],["their",300.68,300.9],["way",300.9,301.08],["home",301.08,301.48]]},{"start":301.48,"end":304.42,"text":"by recognizing landmarks along a familiar trail.","words":[["by",301.48,301.7],["recognizing",301.7,302.18],["landmarks",302.18,303.18],["along",303.18,303.36],["a",303.36,303.58],["familiar",303.58,303.92],["trail.",303.92,304.42]]},{"start":305.0,"end":306.66,"text":"They're not using language for that.","words":[["They're",305.0,305.26],["not",305.26,305.42],["using",305.42,305.76],["language",305.76,306.24],["for",306.24,306.5],["that.",306.5,306.66]]},{"start":306.66,"end":312.5,"text":"that. Some birds can categorize pictures of different species of moths, which look pretty","words":[["that.",306.66,306.72],["Some",307.24,307.76],["birds",307.76,308.22],["can",308.22,308.52],["categorize",308.52,309.28],["pictures",309.28,309.56],["of",309.56,309.9],["different",309.9,310.22],["species",310.22,310.62],["of",310.62,310.94],["moths,",310.94,311.32],["which",311.76,312.02],["look",312.02,312.22],["pretty",312.22,312.5]]},{"start":312.5,"end":319.36,"text":"well the same to the human eye. Sheep can recognize large numbers of people by their faces. Yet","words":[["well",312.5,312.72],["the",312.72,312.9],["same",312.9,313.18],["to",313.18,313.38],["the",313.38,313.52],["human",313.52,313.76],["eye.",313.76,314.1],["Sheep",314.82,315.22],["can",315.22,315.4],["recognize",315.4,315.96],["large",315.96,316.36],["numbers",316.36,316.74],["of",316.74,316.94],["people",316.94,317.28],["by",317.28,317.56],["their",317.56,317.74],["faces.",317.74,318.16],["Yet",319.1,319.36]]},{"start":319.36,"end":324.04,"text":"most of us would have the greatest difficulty telling one sheep from another, wouldn't","words":[["most",319.36,319.72],["of",319.72,319.94],["us",319.94,320.18],["would",320.18,320.56],["have",320.56,320.76],["the",320.76,320.98],["greatest",320.98,321.44],["difficulty",321.44,322.0],["telling",322.0,322.44],["one",322.44,322.8],["sheep",322.8,323.12],["from",323.12,323.36],["another,",323.36,323.74],["wouldn't",323.8,324.04]]},{"start":324.04,"end":328.1,"text":"we? Herbert Terrace, a scientist involved in","words":[["we?",324.04,324.24],["Herbert",325.26,325.58],["Terrace,",325.58,326.2],["a",326.6,326.76],["scientist",326.76,327.18],["involved",327.18,327.74],["in",327.74,328.1]]},{"start":328.1,"end":333.64,"text":"experiments on animal intelligence, makes the important point that studying how animals","words":[["experiments",328.1,328.52],["on",328.52,328.92],["animal",328.92,329.26],["intelligence,",329.26,329.84],["makes",330.42,330.7],["the",330.7,330.96],["important",330.96,331.4],["point",331.4,331.8],["that",331.8,332.42],["studying",332.42,332.92],["how",332.92,333.24],["animals",333.24,333.64]]},{"start":333.64,"end":338.88,"text":"animals perform these tasks is a much more relevant and interesting research activity.","words":[["animals",333.64,333.7],["perform",333.7,334.2],["these",334.2,334.46],["tasks",334.46,335.04],["is",335.04,335.58],["a",335.58,335.72],["much",335.72,336.16],["more",336.16,336.38],["relevant",336.38,336.82],["and",336.82,337.24],["interesting",337.24,337.82],["research",337.82,338.3],["activity.",338.3,338.88]]},{"start":340.12,"end":345.52,"text":"Of course, the model accepts that there is some degree of continuity between animal and","words":[["Of",340.12,340.48],["course,",340.48,340.72],["the",341.12,341.26],["model",341.26,341.58],["accepts",341.58,342.1],["that",342.1,342.58],["there",342.58,342.74],["is",342.74,342.88],["some",342.88,343.14],["degree",343.14,343.5],["of",343.5,343.64],["continuity",343.64,344.22],["between",344.22,344.76],["animal",344.76,345.2],["and",345.2,345.52]]},{"start":345.52,"end":350.92,"text":"human thought. Human beings, for instance, can accurately kick a football while running","words":[["human",345.52,345.86],["thought.",345.86,346.26],["Human",346.88,347.16],["beings,",347.16,347.52],["for",347.66,347.8],["instance,",347.8,348.04],["can",348.58,348.68],["accurately",348.68,349.32],["kick",349.32,349.58],["a",349.58,349.74],["football",349.74,350.06],["while",350.06,350.6],["running",350.6,350.92]]},{"start":350.92,"end":356.02,"text":"towards someone else who is also running. It's clear that animals can perform similar","words":[["towards",350.92,351.2],["someone",351.2,351.64],["else",351.64,351.88],["who",351.88,352.04],["is",352.04,352.14],["also",352.14,352.52],["running.",352.52,352.84],["It's",353.62,353.86],["clear",353.86,354.12],["that",354.12,354.34],["animals",354.34,354.76],["can",354.76,355.1],["perform",355.1,355.56],["similar",355.56,356.02]]},{"start":356.02,"end":361.02,"text":"feats of coordination. You only have to think of the coordination necessary for a","words":[["feats",356.02,356.46],["of",356.46,356.6],["coordination.",356.6,357.04],["You",358.0,358.32],["only",358.32,358.54],["have",358.54,358.7],["to",358.7,358.82],["think",358.82,359.02],["of",359.02,359.18],["the",359.18,359.28],["coordination",359.28,359.7],["necessary",359.7,360.4],["for",360.4,360.8],["a",360.8,361.02]]},{"start":361.02,"end":363.24,"text":"bird to catch an insect in mid-air.","words":[["bird",361.02,361.26],["to",361.26,361.52],["catch",361.52,361.74],["an",361.74,361.94],["insect",361.94,362.46],["in",362.46,362.72],["mid",362.72,363.0],["-air.",363.0,363.24]]},{"start":364.04,"end":368.34,"text":"Nevertheless, our human language exists on a different","words":[["Nevertheless,",364.04,364.64],["our",365.48,365.84],["human",365.84,366.2],["language",366.2,366.72],["exists",366.72,367.46],["on",367.46,367.88],["a",367.88,368.04],["different",368.04,368.34]]},{"start":368.34,"end":369.56,"text":"conceptual plane.","words":[["conceptual",368.34,369.08],["plane.",369.08,369.56]]},{"start":370.42,"end":374.48,"text":"It makes possible what philosophers call meta-representation.","words":[["It",370.42,370.58],["makes",370.58,370.8],["possible",370.8,371.3],["what",371.3,371.52],["philosophers",371.52,372.0],["call",372.0,372.48],["meta",372.48,373.3],["-representation.",373.3,374.48]]},{"start":375.26,"end":378.7,"text":"In other words, thoughts about thoughts, ideas about ideas.","words":[["In",375.26,375.42],["other",375.42,375.56],["words,",375.56,375.9],["thoughts",376.28,376.56],["about",376.56,376.86],["thoughts,",376.86,377.34],["ideas",377.58,377.82],["about",377.82,378.12],["ideas.",378.12,378.7]]},{"start":379.34,"end":382.92,"text":"It is what, for example, makes it possible for us humans to","words":[["It",379.34,379.52],["is",379.52,379.66],["what,",379.66,379.86],["for",379.92,380.02],["example,",380.02,380.42],["makes",380.9,381.16],["it",381.16,381.32],["possible",381.32,381.74],["for",381.74,382.04],["us",382.04,382.22],["humans",382.22,382.56],["to",382.56,382.92]]},{"start":382.92,"end":385.28,"text":"think about whether we want to go to the movies this","words":[["think",382.92,383.12],["about",383.12,383.38],["whether",383.38,383.68],["we",383.68,383.92],["want",383.92,384.1],["to",384.1,384.28],["go",384.28,384.46],["to",384.46,384.56],["the",384.56,384.66],["movies",384.66,385.0],["this",385.0,385.28]]},{"start":385.28,"end":387.32,"text":"afternoon or read a history book.","words":[["afternoon",385.28,385.8],["or",385.8,386.4],["read",386.4,386.62],["a",386.62,386.72],["history",386.72,386.96],["book.",386.96,387.32]]},{"start":387.32,"end":395.0,"text":"animals, believe me, cannot think in this way. Nevertheless, there are researchers who argue","words":[["animals,",387.32,388.6],["believe",389.06,389.52],["me,",389.52,389.88],["cannot",390.06,390.32],["think",390.32,391.02],["in",391.02,391.28],["this"